  <section data-depth="2" id="fs-id1165135208790"><h4 data-type="title">Converting between Radians and Degrees</h4><p id="fs-id1165134031366">Because degrees and radians both measure angles, we need to be able to convert between them. We can easily do so using a proportion.</p>

<div data-type="equation" id="eip-id1165137938686" class="unnumbered" data-label=""> <math display="block"><semantics><mrow>
 <mrow>
  <mfrac>
   <mi>θ</mi>
   <mrow>
    <mn>180</mn>
   </mrow>
  </mfrac>
  <mo>=</mo><mfrac>
   <mrow>
    <msup>
     <mi>θ</mi>
     <mi>R</mi>
    </msup>

   </mrow>
   <mi>π</mi>
  </mfrac>

 </mrow>
</mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mrow>
  <mfrac>
   <mi>θ</mi>
   <mrow>
    <mn>180</mn>
   </mrow>
  </mfrac>
  <mo>=</mo><mfrac>
   <mrow>
    <msup>
     <mi>θ</mi>
     <mi>R</mi>
    </msup>

   </mrow>
   <mi>π</mi>
  </mfrac>

 </mrow></annotation-xml></semantics></math>
</div><p id="eip-id1165135181183">This proportion shows that the measure of angle <span class="os-math-in-para"><math display="inline"><semantics><mrow>
    <mrow>
     <mi>θ</mi></mrow>
   </mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mrow>
     <mi>θ</mi></mrow></annotation-xml></semantics></math></span> in degrees divided by 180 equals the measure of angle <span class="os-math-in-para"><math display="inline"><semantics><mrow>
    <mrow>
     <mi>θ</mi></mrow>
   </mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mrow>
     <mi>θ</mi></mrow></annotation-xml></semantics></math></span> in radians divided by <span class="os-math-in-para"><math display="inline"><semantics><mrow>
    <mrow>
     <mi>π</mi><mo>. </mo></mrow>
   </mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mrow>
     <mi>π</mi><mo>. </mo></mrow></annotation-xml></semantics></math></span> Or, phrased another way, degrees is to 180 as radians is to <span class="os-math-in-para"><math display="inline"><semantics><mrow>
     <mrow>
      <mi>π</mi><mo>.</mo></mrow>
    </mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mrow>
      <mi>π</mi><mo>.</mo></mrow></annotation-xml></semantics></math></span> </p>
