     <div data-type="commentary" id="fs-id1165135613205"><h4 data-type="commentary-title"><span class="os-title-label">Analysis </span></h4>
      <p id="fs-id1165135181641">Another way to think about this problem is by remembering that <span class="os-math-in-para"><math display="inline"><semantics><mrow>
       <mrow>
        <msup>
         <mrow>
