  </mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mrow>
    <mn>3960</mn></mrow></annotation-xml></semantics></math></span> miles.</p></div>
</div>
</section></div>
<div data-type="exercise" id="fs-id1165135565959" class="os-hasSolution"><header></header><section>
 <div data-type="problem" id="fs-id1165135565961">
<a class="os-number" href="chapter-5" aria-label="Go to 67" data-page-slug="chapter-5" data-page-uuid="0194b703-2787-5d4e-9003-ab2a606d4581" data-page-fragment="fs-id1165135565959-solution">67</a><span class="os-divider">. </span>
<div class="os-problem-container">
  <p id="fs-id1165135565964">Consider a clock with an hour hand and minute hand. What is the measure of the angle the minute hand traces in <span class="os-math-in-para"><math display="inline"><semantics><mrow>
   <mrow>
    <mn>20</mn></mrow>
